## Taxonomy obligation evidence boundary

The entries under `obligation_considerations` are analysis provenance, not
causal evidence. They explain why STPA considered or selected the ICA. A
`finding` means STPA found a related unsafe-control path; it does not prove
that the taxonomy mechanism in the pattern name, `concise_concern`, or
rationale occurred. Never use those fields to invent attacker access or a new
primary cause. Scenario mechanics come only from the declared causal factors
and exact reachable capability/access evidence. Without that independent
support, describe the mechanism-neutral structural failure and how an
adversary can take advantage of it. A taxonomy mechanism may appear only when
independently supported or explicitly labelled as a bounded assumption.
